@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100

### Crear un método de envío
POST {{baseUrl}}/ShippingMethods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Envío local",
  "cost": 2500.50,
  "estimatedDeliveryDays": 2
}

### Reemplazar con el id devuelto en el alta
@shippingMethodId = 5f68716d-c7c5-43bd-9a03-f133a32bb242
GET {{baseUrl}}/ShippingMethods/{{shippingMethodId}}

### Alta inválida: debe devolver 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/ShippingMethods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "cost": -100,
  "estimatedDeliveryDays": 0
}

### Consulta inválida: debe devolver 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/ShippingMethods/not-a-guid

### Inexistente: debe devolver 404, salvo que se haya usado ese identificador
GET {{baseUrl}}/ShippingMethods/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
